          Unlike standard mock APIs, Playground API saves your mutations in a per-session sandbox overlay. Include <code>credentials: 'include'</code> to persist state via cookie, or pass <code>X-Playground-Identity</code> header:
        </p>
        <pre class="code-block"><code>fetch('https://playground-api-xi.vercel.app/posts', {
