      </div>
      <div style="background: var(--bg-sidebar); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem;">
        <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">Inactivity TTL</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Mutations persist for up to 10 days of inactivity before automatic cleanup.</div>
